        "en": "Shallow-water equations"
      },
      "formula": [
        "h_t+(hu)_x=0",
        "(hu)_t+(hu^2+gh^2/2)_x=0",
        "u_t-fv=-g\\eta_x,\\quad v_t+fu=-g\\eta_y",
        "\\eta_t+H(u_x+v_y)=0"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "前2式は平坦床・摩擦なしの1次元系。後2行は水深Hまわりの線形回転系。非線形流れのテストと、回転系のFourier記号の検証を区別します。",
        "en": "The first two equations are 1D flat-bed, frictionless flow; the remaining lines are the linear rotating system about depth H. Distinguish nonlinear flow tests from rotating-system Fourier-symbol checks."
      },
      "url": {
