      },
      "title": {
        "ja": "浅水流／水深が正のダム崩壊",
        "en": "Shallow water / wet dam break"
      },
      "formula": "U(x,t) = R((x−x0)/t)",
      "assumptions": {
        "ja": "平坦な底面と一定の重力g。乾床は参照解のみの対応で、既存の有限体積ソルバーでは扱えません。",
        "en": "Flat bottom; constant g; dry states allowed in the reference only, not the existing FV solver."
      },
      "relation": "related-model",
      "note": {
        "ja": "湿潤河床、g=1、左右水深(2,1)・速度0、x0=0.5が一致します。乾燥河床例への対応ではありません。 物理的な入力は一致しますが、参照カードの点値標本と保存計算の有限体積セル平均・離散格子は別表現です。",
        "en": "Wet bed, g=1, depths (2,1), zero velocities and x0=0.5 match; this is not a dry-bed correspondence. Physical inputs match, but the card’s point samples and the saved computation’s finite-volume cell averages/discrete grid are different representations."
      },
      "url": {
        "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/?lang=ja#/exact-solutions?case=swe-dam-break",
        "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/?lang=en#/exact-solutions?case=swe-dam-break"
      }
    }
  ],
  "reference_note": {
    "ja": "水深2と1、静止状態、g=1の湿潤河床Riemann解を半解析的に評価します。乾燥河床解の収録は、この有限体積コードの乾燥状態対応を意味しません。",
    "en": "Use the semi-analytic wet-bed Riemann solution for depths 2 and 1, initially at rest, g=1. Library dry-bed formulas do not establish dry-state support in this finite-volume code."
